    <main class="legal-body">

      <div class="legal-note">
        <p><strong>Plain-language summary.</strong> Surfcast is a forecasting tool, not a safety device. The data is provided "as is" from third-party weather models and may be wrong. Always use your own judgement before entering the water. This summary is for convenience only — the full terms below apply.</p>
      </div>

      <section id="acceptance">
        <h2><span class="num">01</span>Acceptance of terms</h2>
        <p>By installing or using Surfcast (the "App") or visiting surfcastapp.com (the "Site"), you confirm that you accept these Terms of Use and agree to comply with them. If you do not agree, you must not use the App or the Site.</p>
        <p>You must be at least 13 years old, or the minimum age of digital consent in your country, to use Surfcast. If you are under the age of majority where you live, you should review these terms with a parent or guardian.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="service">
        <h2><span class="num">02</span>The service</h2>
        <p>Surfcast provides surf and marine weather forecasts, including wave height, swell period and direction, wind, tide and related data for surf spots worldwide. The App is currently distributed through the Apple App Store and may be offered free of charge or with optional paid features.</p>
        <p>We may add, change, suspend or remove features at any time. We may also limit the availability of the service in certain regions or to certain users at our discretion.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="forecast">
        <h2><span class="num">03</span>Forecast data &amp; safety</h2>
        <p>Surfcast aggregates forecasts produced by global numerical weather and wave models operated by third parties. Forecasts are <strong>predictions, not guarantees</strong>. Actual ocean conditions can differ significantly from any forecast and can change rapidly.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Never rely on Surfcast as your sole source of information before entering the water.</li>
          <li>Surfing and ocean activities carry inherent risks, including serious injury and death.</li>
          <li>Always assess conditions in person, heed local warnings and lifeguards, and surf within your ability.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You are solely responsible for decisions you make based on information in the App.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="use">
        <h2><span class="num">04</span>Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to misuse the App or Site. In particular, you must not:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Copy, scrape, resell or redistribute forecast data or other content except as expressly permitted.</li>
          <li>Reverse engineer, decompile or attempt to extract the source code of the App, except where permitted by law.</li>
          <li>Interfere with, disrupt or place undue load on our systems or networks.</li>
          <li>Use the service for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any applicable regulation.</li>
