        <p>Forecast and map data is sourced from third parties, which may include national and international meteorological services and mapping providers. Their data is subject to their own terms and licences. We are not responsible for the accuracy, availability or content of any third-party data or service, and references to them do not imply endorsement.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="disclaimer">
        <h2><span class="num">07</span>Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
        <p>The App and Site are provided on an <strong>"as is" and "as available"</strong> basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, accuracy and non-infringement. We do not warrant that the service will be uninterrupted, error-free, secure, or that any forecast will be accurate.</p>
